Each component is a separately deploy-able artefact, but we need a coherent single URL to link them all. The normal method would be to deploy out each individual component to Azure and each would get its own ‘aurewebsites.com’ URL. This approach would lead to confusion, as it would mean you would need to keep lists of URL’s By using the proxy feature of Azure Functions we can define routes to each of the installed artefacts while preserving a single URL for the application. So:-



Route
Result




